### Code Review Checklist:
- [ ] Follows BLoC pattern where appropriate
- [ ] Proper error handling and logging
- [ ] Uses design tokens consistently
- [ ] No lint violations
- [ ] Responsive design considerations
- [ ] Memory leaks prevented
- [ ] Proper state management
- [ ] Clean, readable code structure

### Performance Checklist:
- [ ] No unnecessary rebuilds
- [ ] Efficient list rendering (lazy builders, no intrinsic operations)
- [ ] Proper image caching
- [ ] Minimal bundle size impact
- [ ] Smooth animations and transitions
- [ ] Frames render in 16ms or less (60fps target)
- [ ] No excessive saveLayer() calls
- [ ] Opacity and clipping used efficiently
- [ ] No intrinsic layout passes causing performance issues
